          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"section-6-the-listen-loop\">Section 6: the listen loop</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Bind, listen, accept. Each connection gets one OS thread, but we cap the total via a semaphore \u2014 past that, new connections get an immediate 503 and close, so a flood can't OOM the process.  </span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
